- Responding timely to Human Resources inquiries from DDC staff;
- Supporting DDC's recruitment program by creating job openings in NYCAPS for all vacancies and ensuring all job openings are shared on the DDC HUB;
- Reviewing resumes to assess whether candidates meet the minimum qualifications for roles within the agency;
